---
// 首页 = 物理 playground 本体。路由优先级高于 Starlight 的 content collection。
const SOURCE = 'https://github.com/erayzesen/QuarkPhysics';
const AUTHOR = 'Eray Zesen';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>软体物理 playground · 戳一下会弹半天的果冻</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="把 QuarkPhysics 的软体物理算法用 JS 重写成网页版：果冻、弹簧链、箱子堆叠、布袋娃娃，鼠标能拖能甩能扔，刚度阻尼重力压强实时可调，不用装 SFML 和 CMake。"
    />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://quark.leolee0812.site/" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="软体物理 playground · 戳一下会弹半天的果冻" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="原项目要装 SFML + CMake 才能看到效果，这里点开就能玩。"
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://quark.leolee0812.site/" />
    <link
      rel="icon"
      href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Ccircle cx='16' cy='16' r='11' fill='none' stroke='%234de2ff' stroke-width='3'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='16' cy='16' r='3' fill='%23ff5fa8'/%3E%3C/svg%3E"
    />
    <script
      defer
      src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js"
      data-cf-beacon='{"token": "48701f7045fb436d9e1a677adce6b2e6"}'></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="glow glow-a"></div>
    <div class="glow glow-b"></div>

    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="brand">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <span>软体物理 playground</span>
      </div>
      <a class="src" href={SOURCE} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        算法源自 {AUTHOR} / QuarkPhysics · MIT ↗
      </a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>
          <span>戳一下，</span>
          <span class="hl">它会弹半天</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lede">
          原项目是个 C++ 写的 2D 软体物理引擎，效果很好，但要看到得先装 SFML 和 CMake 编译。
          这里把它的算法用 JS 重写了一遍，<b>直接用鼠标（或手指）拖、甩、扔</b>。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="board">
        <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
          <button data-scene="jelly" class="tab">果冻广场</button>
          <button data-scene="chain" class="tab">弹簧链</button>
          <button data-scene="stack" class="tab">箱子堆叠</button>
          <button data-scene="ragdoll" class="tab">布袋娃娃</button>
        </div>

        <div id="stage-wrap" class="stage-wrap">
          <canvas id="stage"></canvas>
          <div class="overlay">
            <span id="stat" class="stat">载入中</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p id="hint" class="hint"></p>

        <div class="panel">
          <div class="knob">
            <label for="s-stiffness">刚度 <i>越低越软塌</i></label>
            <input id="s-stiffness" type="range" min="0.18" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.7" />
            <output id="v-stiffness">0.70</output>
          </div>
          <div class="knob">
            <label for="s-damping">阻尼 <i>越低晃得越久</i></label>
            <input id="s-damping" type="range" min="0.985" max="1" step="0.001" value="0.999" />
            <output id="v-damping">0.999</output>
          </div>
          <div class="knob">
            <label for="s-gravity">重力 <i>调到 0 就是太空</i></label>
            <input id="s-gravity" type="range" min="0" max="3600" step="20" value="1700" />
            <output id="v-gravity">1700</output>
          </div>
          <div class="knob">
            <label for="s-pressure">压强 <i>把果冻吹胀或抽瘪</i></label>
            <input id="s-pressure" type="range" min="0.7" max="2.2" step="0.01" value="1" />
            <output id="v-pressure">1.00</output>
          </div>
          <div class="acts">
            <button id="btn-wire" class="ghost">线框：关</button>
            <button id="btn-reset" class="ghost">重置场景</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="notes">
        <h2>它其实只在算四件事</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <article>
            <h3>1 · 质点和距离约束</h3>
            <p>
              没有「刚体」这种东西，全场只有一堆质点。用 Verlet 积分推它们往下掉，
              再反复把每两个相连的质点拉回原本的距离。这就是 mass-spring model。
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>2 · 面积约束（压强）</h3>
            <p>
              果冻不塌，是因为它的轮廓面积被约束住了：算出当前围成的面积，
              和静止面积差多少，就顺着面积对每个质点的梯度方向把它们推回去。拖压强滑块就是在改这个目标面积。
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>3 · 形状匹配</h3>
            <p>
              箱子能堆四层不倒，靠的是每帧求一个最贴合原始形状的旋转，
              再把质点往这个「理想位置」拉。拉满就接近刚体，拉一点点就是有记忆的软体。
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>4 · 碰撞就是推出去</h3>
            <p>
              质点掉进别人的多边形里，就沿最近的边推出来，反作用力按质量分给这条边的两个端点，
              再削掉一点切向速度当摩擦。整套求解器是 PBD——只改位置，速度自己就对了。
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="more">
          想看这几条约束在代码里长什么样：<a href="/guide/">算法笔记 →</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="credit">
        <h2>关于原项目</h2>
        <p>
          <a href={SOURCE} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>QuarkPhysics</b></a> 是
          {AUTHOR} 写的 2D 物理引擎，C++，MIT 协议，2023 年 4 月开源，至今仍在更新。
          它同时支持刚体和软体：mass-spring、面积体积保持、形状匹配、自碰撞、PBD dynamics，
          还有一个 Godot 引擎的绑定版本。
        </p>
        <p>
          <b>本站不是移植，是照着它公开的算法思路用 JavaScript 重新实现的一个玩具版</b>，
          手感和精度都不代表原引擎水平。要认真做游戏，请直接用原项目。
        </p>
        <p class="links">
          <a href={SOURCE} target="_blank" rel="noopener">原仓库 GitHub ↗</a>
          <a href="https://erayzesen.github.io/QuarkPhysics/documentation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
            >原项目文档 ↗</a
          >
          <a href="/guide/">本站算法笔记</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>AI 知识开放计划 · 第 17 期</span>
      <span>算法与设计版权归 {AUTHOR}（QuarkPhysics, MIT License）</span>
    </footer>

    <script>
      import '../scripts/app.js';
    </script>

    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --bg: #070a12;
        --panel: rgba(18, 24, 40, 0.72);
        --line: rgba(120, 160, 255, 0.16);
        --txt: #e7eefc;
        --dim: #8ea0c2;
        --cy: #4de2ff;
        --pk: #ff5fa8;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      body {
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--txt);
        font-family:
          -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB',
          'Microsoft YaHei', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        position: relative;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      .glow {
        position: fixed;
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(90px);
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
      }
      .glow-a {
        width: 520px;
        height: 520px;
        background: rgba(77, 226, 255, 0.13);
        top: -180px;
        left: -140px;
      }
      .glow-b {
        width: 460px;
        height: 460px;
        background: rgba(255, 95, 168, 0.11);
        top: 30%;
        right: -180px;
      }

      .topbar {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 14px 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        font-size: 15px;
      }
      .brand .dot {
        width: 11px;
        height: 11px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--cy);
        box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--cy);
      }
      .src {
        color: var(--dim);
        font-size: 12.5px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(142, 160, 194, 0.4);
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
      }
      .src:hover {
        color: var(--cy);
      }

      main {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 1060px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 20px 40px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 26px 0 16px;
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(30px, 6.4vw, 54px);
        line-height: 1.14;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        font-weight: 800;
      }
      h1 span {
        display: block;
      }
      h1 .hl {
        background: linear-gradient(92deg, var(--cy), var(--pk));
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }
      .lede {
        margin: 12px 0 0;
        color: var(--dim);
        font-size: clamp(13.5px, 3.4vw, 16px);
        line-height: 1.72;
        max-width: 62ch;
      }
      .lede b {
        color: var(--txt);
      }

      .tabs {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        padding-bottom: 10px;
        scrollbar-width: none;
      }
      .tabs::-webkit-scrollbar {
        display: none;
      }
      .tab {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--dim);
        padding: 8px 15px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-family: inherit;
        transition: 0.16s;
      }
      .tab:hover {
        color: var(--txt);
      }
      .tab.on {
        background: rgba(77, 226, 255, 0.14);
        border-color: rgba(77, 226, 255, 0.55);
        color: #dff8ff;
        box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(77, 226, 255, 0.18);
      }

      .stage-wrap {
        position: relative;
        height: min(60vh, 560px);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background:
          radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, rgba(60, 100, 180, 0.15), transparent 65%),
          #060911;
        touch-action: none;
      }
      #stage {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        cursor: grab;
      }
      .overlay {
        position: absolute;
        top: 10px;
        right: 12px;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .stat {
        font-size: 11.5px;
        color: rgba(190, 210, 240, 0.6);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        background: rgba(6, 10, 20, 0.5);
        padding: 3px 8px;
        border-radius: 6px;
      }
      .hint {
        margin: 10px 2px 14px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--dim);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .panel {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
        gap: 14px 22px;
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      }
      .knob label {
        display: block;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        color: #cddcf5;
      }
      .knob label i {
        font-style: normal;
        color: #6c7f9f;
        font-size: 11.5px;
        margin-left: 4px;
      }
      .knob {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
        grid-template-areas: 'l l' 'i o';
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0 10px;
      }
      .knob label {
        grid-area: l;
      }
      .knob input {
        grid-area: i;
      }
      .knob output {
        grid-area: o;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--cy);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        min-width: 44px;
        text-align: right;
      }
      input[type='range'] {
        -webkit-appearance: none;
        appearance: none;
        width: 100%;
        height: 22px;
        background: transparent;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      input[type='range']::-webkit-slider-runnable-track {
        height: 4px;
        border-radius: 2px;
        background: rgba(140, 175, 235, 0.22);
      }
      input[type='range']::-webkit-slider-thumb {
        -webkit-appearance: none;
        width: 17px;
        height: 17px;
        margin-top: -6.5px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--cy);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(77, 226, 255, 0.7);
      }
      input[type='range']::-moz-range-track {
        height: 4px;
        border-radius: 2px;
        background: rgba(140, 175, 235, 0.22);
      }
      input[type='range']::-moz-range-thumb {
        width: 15px;
        height: 15px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--cy);
      }
      .acts {
        display: flex;
        gap: 9px;
        align-items: flex-end;
      }
      .ghost {
        flex: 1;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: #cddcf5;
        border-radius: 9px;
        padding: 9px 10px;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-family: inherit;
      }
      .ghost:hover {
        border-color: rgba(77, 226, 255, 0.5);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .ghost.on {
        background: rgba(77, 226, 255, 0.14);
        border-color: rgba(77, 226, 255, 0.55);
        color: #dff8ff;
      }

      .notes,
      .credit {
        margin-top: 42px;
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: clamp(19px, 4.4vw, 25px);
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(255px, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
      }
      .cards article {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 13px;
        padding: 16px 17px;
      }
      .cards h3 {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-size: 14.5px;
        color: var(--cy);
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .cards p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 13.2px;
        line-height: 1.78;
        color: #a8b8d4;
      }
      .more {
        margin-top: 16px;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        color: var(--dim);
      }
      .credit p {
        font-size: 13.6px;
        line-height: 1.85;
        color: #a8b8d4;
        max-width: 74ch;
      }
      .credit b {
        color: var(--txt);
      }
      a {
        color: var(--cy);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      .links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 16px;
        font-size: 13.5px;
      }

      footer {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        margin-top: 44px;
        padding: 20px;
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 6px 18px;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6c7f9f;
        text-align: center;
      }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        main {
          padding: 0 14px 32px;
        }
        .topbar {
          padding: 11px 14px;
          gap: 8px;
        }
        .src {
          font-size: 11px;
          max-width: 46%;
        }
        .hero {
          padding: 18px 0 12px;
        }
        .lede {
          margin-top: 9px;
        }
        .stage-wrap {
          height: 46vh;
          min-height: 320px;
          border-radius: 13px;
        }
        .panel {
          padding: 13px 14px;
          gap: 11px 16px;
        }
        .acts {
          margin-top: 2px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
